This file is created to demonstrate Hadoop Distributed File System operations.

The following HDFS commands were executed:

1. mkdir – to create directory
2. touchz – to create empty file
3. put – to upload file
4. cat – to read file
5. cp – to copy file
6. mv – to move file
7. rm – to delete file

Result:
Basic HDFS commands were successfully executed.

